%% Phase 39 — single source of truth: UserProfile.progression drives
%% every UI totalXp/coins/level. Legacy PlaygroundProvider ChangeNotifier
%% is stripped of XP-mutation side-effects; it only tracks
%% completed/unlocked nodes. The canonical funnel pushes the freshly
%% updated profile's progression into playgroundProgressProvider via
%% _pushProgressionIntoPlayground, so the world-map UI mirrors
%% UserProfile.progression exactly.
J8["QuizResultController.submit() → UserProgressService.applyQuizCompletion() — earned XP = Σ q.mark for correct answers (Phase 38 contract)"]
J9["UserProgressService._nextProfile() computes new progression from result.rewardXp/rewardCoins"]
J10["profileControllerProvider.replaceLocalProfile(updated) — instant UI totalXp/coins/level sync"]
J11["UserProgressService._pushProgressionIntoPlayground(playground, updated) — playgroundProgressProvider.replace(current.copyWith(progression))"]
J12["PlaygroundNotifier.replace() — PlaygroundProvider.replace() is now the only path that mutates totalXp/coins/level/streak in playground state"]
J13["PlaygroundProvider.markCompleted/grantBossReward/grantRewardChest track only completed/unlocked node ids; XP/coins deltas = 0 (no hardcoded 25/100/15 literals)"]
J14["LevelScreen / ChallengeScreen / BossChallengeScreen convert to ConsumerWidget; read xpReward/coinReward from categoryByIdProvider(nodeId) → CategoryEntity"]
J15["RewardPopup entries bind to dynamic rewards.xp / rewards.coins — no `amount: 25` or `amount: 100` literals in playground screens"]
J16["Every XP indicator (Profile badge, Quiz Result, Playground card, Reward Popup, Top Bar, Mission screen) renders from provider state — no widget hardcodes XP"]

J8-->J9-->J10-->J11-->J12-->J13
J11-->J14
J13-->J14
J14-->J15-->J16
J10-->J16
J12-->J16

end

