subgraph Phase40["Phase 40 — Dynamic Level System (Implemented)"]

K1["lib/core/services/level_curve.dart — LevelCurve (base=100, growth=1.25) + LevelSnapshot (level, xpForNext, previousLevelThreshold, nextLevelThreshold) — single source of truth"]
K2["UserProgressService._nextProfile + _transactionalProgression — LevelCurve.defaultCurve.compute(previousXp) / compute(newXp) detects levelDelta, freezes per-level reward magnitudes"]
K3["Auto Level Up — _buildPendingLevelReward appends to ProgressionEntity.pendingLevelRewards; _mergePendingRewards preserves claimed entries inside the Firestore transaction"]
K4["Rewards — PendingLevelReward (level, xpBonus=xpCost/4, coinBonus=xpCost/10, badgeId=level_<n>_clear every 5 levels, unlockedTitles=[Legendary Scholar] every 10); claimLevelReward writes claimed=true via merge"]
K5["Animations — lib/app.dart root ref.listen<LevelUpEvent?> pops LevelRewardDialog (showConfetti=true) with ConfettiAnimation layered above _CelebrationField; LevelRewardQueueNotifier drains unclaimedRewards"]
K6["Firestore Sync — users/{uid}/progression/current (atomic transaction) + progressionWriteRetryQueueProvider (offline flush); levelUpEventBusProvider fires LevelUpEvent per crossed level; streak_state_provider listens on profileControllerProvider"]

K1-->K2-->K3-->K4-->K5-->K6

end

