subgraph Phase42["Phase 42 — Mission Progress Backend Integration (Implemented)"]

M1["UserProgressService.applyQuizCompletion — step 7: unawaited(_propagateQuizToMissions(session, result, categoryId))"]
M2["MissionsController.recordQuizAttempt(sessionId, score, category, quizId, completedAtIso) — funnel entry point"]
M3["MissionProgressService.recordAttempt({uid, mission, attempt}) — single writer to users/{uid}/mission_progress/{missionId}"]
M4["firestore.runTransaction — re-read summary doc → dedup check completionTimestampsIso.contains(sessionId) → _mergeAttempt pure transition → tx.set(summaryRef, updated.toMap())"]
M5["DuplicateMissionAttemptFailure on dedup hit; GuestMissionWriteFailure when uid isEmpty; controller falls back to _incrementLocalCatalogProgress"]
M6["users/{uid}/mission_progress/{missionId} — one doc per mission; doc shape: uid, missionId, stars, bestScore, completionStatus (locked|unlocked|started|completed|perfect|expired), completionTimestampsIso (capped 50 newest-first), totalCompleted, currentMissionId?, rewardsClaimed, lastUpdatedAtIso"]
M7["MissionProgressRepository — abstract contract + MissionProgressRepositoryImpl wrapping the service"]
M8["MissionProgressRemoteDataSource — FirestoreMissionProgressRemoteDataSource (CollectionReference.snapshots) + InMemoryMissionProgressRemoteDataSource (test/offline fallback)"]
M9["MissionSummaryEntity — domain entity with stars (monotonic), bestScore (Math.max protected), completionStatus (perfect is sticky), history list, totalCompleted"]
M10["MissionProgressAttempt — value object carrying sessionId (dedup key), score, achievedGoal, completedAtIso, metadata"]
M11["Stars transition: +1 (goal only), +2 (>=80%), +3 (100%); monotonic non-decreasing inside transaction"]
M12["Best score transition: newBestScore = max(prev, attempt.score) — never overwritten with a lower score"]
M13["Completion status transition: unlocked -> started -> completed -> perfect; perfect is sticky"]
M14["MissionProgressBundle — aggregate (summaries, totalCompleted, totalStars, bestScoreOverall); surfaced via missionProgressBundleProvider (StreamProvider.autoDispose)"]
M15["MissionsController._subscribeSummaries — service.watch(uid) subscription; re-emits whenever authStateProvider changes"]
M16["MissionsViewState.summaries keyed by missionId — convenience getters effectiveProgress / completionStatus / bestScore / stars read the realtime summary first then fall back to catalog"]
M17["MissionsController.claim — post grant loop calls MissionProgressService.markRewardsClaimed(uid, missionId) — idempotent"]
M18["Guest path (auth.user.id isEmpty) — recordQuizAttempt routes to _incrementLocalCatalogProgress which mutates state.daily/weekly/monthly in place"]
M19["Datasource selection: FirestoreMissionProgressRemoteDataSource when FirebaseConfig.firestore != null; otherwise InMemoryMissionProgressRemoteDataSource"]
M20["MissionsHubScreen + ProfileScreen + Playground + Statistics — all read from MissionsController; no local rebuilds"]

