subgraph Phase43["Phase 43 — Backend Statistics System (Implemented)"]

N1["QuizResultController.submit() → UserProgressService.applyQuizCompletion() — step 8: unawaited(_recordQuizCompletionStats(session, result, categoryId))"]
N2["UserProgressService._recordQuizCompletionStats — resolves subjectName via _resolveSubjectName(categoriesStreamProvider) and builds QuizStatisticsInput"]
N3["StatisticsService.recordQuizCompletion({uid, input}) — funnel entry point; returns Result<UserStatisticsEntity>"]
N4["firestore.runTransaction — re-read users/{uid}/statistics/current + users/{uid}/category_statistics/{categoryId} in one tx"]
N5["Dedup: previousUser.lastSessionIds.contains(sessionId) || previousCategory.lastSessionIds.contains(sessionId) → DuplicateStatisticsFailure (sessionKey='uid:categoryId:sessionId')"]
N6["Pure transitions: _mergeUserStats + _mergeCategoryStats — monotonic counters; bestScore = max(prev, attempt.score); EMA with alpha=0.2 for averageTimeSecondsPerQuestion"]
N7["tx.set(userStatsRef, nextUser.toMap(), merge:true) + tx.set(categoryStatsRef, nextCategory.toMap(), merge:true) — single atomic commit"]
N8["Failure types: DuplicateStatisticsFailure(sessionKey), GuestStatisticsWriteFailure; DebugPrint on transaction error so the funnel never breaks"]
N9["FirestoreKeys.statisticsSubcollection + categoryStatisticsSubcollection — `users/{uid}/statistics/current` + `users/{uid}/category_statistics/{categoryId}`"]
N10["users/{uid}/statistics/current — doc shape: uid, totalAnswered, correctAnswers, wrongAnswers, accuracy, averageTimeSecondsPerQuestion, totalStudyMinutes, totalXp, totalCoins, lastSessionIds (capped 50), lastUpdatedAtIso"]
N11["users/{uid}/category_statistics/{categoryId} — doc shape: uid, categoryId, subjectName (resolved at write time), totalQuestions, correct, wrong, skipped, bestScore (monotonic), averageSecondsPerQuestion (EMA), totalMinutes, xpEarned, lastSessionIds, lastUpdatedAtIso"]
N12["UserStatisticsEntity + CategoryStatisticsEntity — @immutable domain entities with copyWith / toMap / fromMap / == / hashCode; accuracyPercent getter; isPriority (>=5 total && <60% accuracy)"]
N13["StatisticsAggregator — pure converter: UserStatisticsEntity + List<CategoryStatisticsEntity> → StatisticsEntity / StudyStatisticsEntity / List<SubjectStatisticsEntity>"]
N14["toWeakSubjects (accuracyPercent < 60) + toStrongSubjects (accuracyPercent >= 75) — read-time derivations, never persisted"]
N15["StatisticsService.watch(uid) → Stream<UserStatisticsEntity> via users/{uid}/statistics/current.snapshots()"]
N16["StatisticsService.watchCategories(uid) → Stream<List<CategoryStatisticsEntity>> via users/{uid}/category_statistics.snapshots()"]
N17["StatisticsService.summary(uid) + category({uid, categoryId}) — one-shot reads for controllers; empty entities for guests"]
N18["StatisticsRepository — legacy one-shot API preserved (getStatistics / getStudyStatistics / getAccuracyStatistics / getWeakSubjects / getStrongSubjects)"]
N19["StatisticsRepositoryImpl — wraps StatisticsService; snapshot() rebuilds legacy StatisticsEntity / StudyStatisticsEntity / SubjectStatisticsEntity via StatisticsAggregator"]
N20["StatisticsRepository.watch(uid) — joins user + category streams through StreamController.broadcast; emits StatisticsSnapshot only when both latestUser + latestCategories are present"]
N21["userStatisticsStreamProvider + categoryStatisticsStreamProvider — StreamProvider.autoDispose gated on authStateProvider; uid='' → empty entity / empty list"]
N22["statisticsRepositoryProvider — Provider<StatisticsRepository> default wiring; statisticsServiceProvider — Provider<StatisticsService>"]
N23["StatisticsController._subscribe — ref.listen on userStatisticsStreamProvider + categoryStatisticsStreamProvider; re-emits on every snapshot; authStateProvider changes re-open subscriptions"]
N24["StatisticsController exposes live accuracy / correctAnswers / wrongAnswers / averageTime / weakSubjects / strongSubjects / subjectBreakdown; no mock or hardcoded literals"]
N25["StatisticsScreen / StudyStatisticsScreen / SubjectsBreakdownScreen consume StatisticsController — single source of truth"]
N26["Guest guard — uid.isEmpty returns UserStatisticsEntity.empty / [] / Result.failure(GuestStatisticsWriteFailure); _writeDirectly offline fallback when FirebaseConfig.firestore is null"]
N27["EMA math: newAvg = (prev * 0.8) + (avgSeconds * 0.2) when prev != 0; prev == 0 seed → avgSeconds — recent attempts dominate"]
N28["Monotonic guards: totalAnswered += totalQuestions (never -=), correct += correctAnswers, wrong += wrongAnswers + skippedAnswers, bestScore = max(prev, attempt.score)"]
N29["QuizStatisticsInput value object — sessionId (dedup key), categoryId, subjectName, totalQuestions, correctAnswers, wrongAnswers, skippedAnswers, scorePercent, totalSeconds, xpEarned, coinsEarned, completedAtIso"]
N30["AccuracyPercent = (correct / totalAnswered) * 100 (rounded) — recomputed server-side on every merge; subjectName frozen at first-write so catalog renames don't relabel history"]

