subgraph Phase44["Phase 44 — Leaderboards Backend Integration (Implemented)"]

O1["QuizResultController.submit() → UserProgressService.applyQuizCompletion() — step 9: unawaited(_refreshLeaderboardEntries(uid, updated))"]
O2["UserProgressService._refreshLeaderboardEntries → LeaderboardService.recordQuizCompletion(uid, profile, statistics, missionSummaries)"]
O3["LeaderboardService — single Firestore writer; rebuilds per-scope ranking row from canonical sources (profile + statistics + missions)"]
O4["firestore.runTransaction: re-read users/{uid}/leaderboard_entries/{scope}__{seasonId} → merge ranking payload → tx.set(merge: true)"]
O5["users/{uid}/leaderboard_entries/{scope}__{seasonId} — doc shape: uid, scope (friends|university|national|weekly|seasonal), seasonId, username, university, avatarUrl, level, xp, coins, streakDays, accuracyPercent, completedCategories, completedMissions, badges, isPremium, previousRank, lastUpdatedAtIso"]
O6["LeaderboardSeason.currentWeekId() → 'YYYY-Www' (ISO week); currentSeasonId() → 'YYYY-Qn' (calendar quarter); lifetime scope uses 'lifetime'"]
O7["LeaderboardRankingEntity — composite score = xp + level*100 + completedCategories*50 + completedMissions*75 + accuracyPercent + coins*0.05 + streakDays*20 (computed at read-time)"]
O8["Ranking inputs: XP from ProgressionEntity.totalXp; level from ProgressionEntity.level; coins from ProgressionEntity.coins; streak from ProgressionEntity.streakDays; accuracy from UserStatisticsEntity.accuracyPercent; completedCategories from statistics.accuracyPercent >= 60; completedMissions from MissionProgressBundle.summaries filtered by completionStatus ∈ {completed, perfect}"]
O9["LeaderboardRemoteDataSource — Firestore reader; replaces historic UnimplementedError stub; projects realtime rows into legacy LeaderboardCategoryModel shape"]
O10["write(LeaderboardScope, LeaderboardCategoryModel) — documented no-op; LeaderboardService is the only writer; preserves backward compatibility with pre-existing test stubs"]
O11["FirestoreLeaderboardRemoteDataSource — alternative top-N users query (preserves pre-existing test path); signature aligned with optional uid/preview params"]
O12["LeaderboardRepositoryImpl — remote-first; uidProvider closure reads authStateProvider.user.id; falls back to local seed when remote errors / no rows / guest"]
O13["leaderboardCategoryStreamProvider.family<LeaderboardScope> — StreamProvider.autoDispose; auth-aware; emits LeaderboardCategoryEntity on every Firestore snapshot"]
O14["LeaderboardController — ref.listen on leaderboardCategoryStreamProvider for every scope; merges fresh entries into LeaderboardViewState; re-emits on auth state change"]
O15["LeaderboardEntryEntity — optional accuracyPercent / completedCategories / completedMissions / score / seasonId fields (defaults preserve every existing constructor call site)"]
O16["LeaderboardEntryModel — JSON round-trip for new fields; isCurrentUser continues to drive the gold-highlight row in LeaderboardRankTile / LeaderboardRankBadge / LeaderboardCurrentUserCard"]
O17["Guest guard — uid.isEmpty returns UserStatisticsEntity.empty / empty list / falls back to local preview; LeaderboardService.recordQuizCompletion silently skips"]
O18["LeaderboardEntryEntity.rankChange / rankDelta — derived from previousRank field; monotonic non-decreasing previousRank preserved across writes so the rank-change arrow survives reconnects"]
O19["Funnel integration: applyQuizCompletion steps 1-8 (profile XP/coins/level + streak + category progress + playground + quiz sessions + missions + statistics) run before the leaderboard write; step 9 is unawaited so the canonical funnel never blocks"]
O20["LeaderboardScreen + LeaderboardDetailScreen + 15 leaderboard widgets — no UI changes; existing entries surface ranking inputs transparently via the new optional fields"]

