R20["Idempotency — deterministic noteId (existing note.id) ensures re-saving the same note collapses into the same Firestore doc (no duplicate rows, no merge conflicts across devices)"]
R21["Best-effort writes — NoteService.add / remove / clearAll catch all errors and debugPrint + return safely; the local cache is the canonical UI mirror so the user never sees a failed save"]
R22["FirestoreKeys.notesSubcollection = 'notes' + highlightsSubcollection = 'highlights' + aiNotesSubcollection = 'ai_notes' — constants added under users/{uid}/* subcollection block"]
